    <name>Centre Hospitalier Régional de Tambacounda</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hospital</b><br/>Av. Léopold Sédar Senghor, Tambacounda · +221 33 981 10 28 / +221 33 981 12 18. Hospital de referencia del este del país.<br/><a href="https://theawakeman.github.io/africa2027/paises/senegal/#logistica">Ver ficha completa</a> · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=13.77345,-13.6697">Google Maps</a>]]></description>
